    ☐ Preserve the public constants `register_width`, `byte_count`, and `lane_count` with the physical/logical meanings approved above, and add the partial-specific counts without renaming the Register-compatible constants.
    ☐ Preserve each counterpart's static/member form, template parameters, `[[nodiscard]]`, `constexpr`, `noexcept`, `SIMD_FLAGS`, and `requires` availability except where an explicitly documented partial-lane constraint or result type must differ.
